#. Tag: title
#: extragear-applications.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "Graphics"
msgstr "Grafisme"

#. Tag: term
#: extragear-applications.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "&digikam;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A photo management application which can conveniently organize and import "
"digital photos. Features include complete tagging functionality, a plugin "
"system, and a fully-featured comment system. &digikam; also makes use of "
"<acronym>KIPI</acronym> (&kde; Image Plugin Interface), therefore contributing "
"to the initiative to create a common plugin infrastructure, which allows "
"development of image plugins that can be shared among graphical applications in "
"&kde; (others include <application>Gwenview</application>, <application>"
"ShowImg</application> and <application>KimDaBa</application>)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid "Website: <ulink url=\"http://digikam.org\">http://digikam.org</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: extragear-applications.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "&digikam; Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: application
#: extragear-applications.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gwenview"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Another advanced image viewer which can load and save all image formats "
"supported by &kde;, as well as being able to display the <application>"
"GIMP</application> (*.<acronym>xcf</acronym>) image filetype. <application>"
"Gwenview</application> can perform a few graphical manipulations (rotate, "
"mirroring) and has full support for KIO slaves (allowing you to use it via "
"&FTP;). Other features also include file management operations, such as copy, "
"paste, move and delete."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://gwenview.sourceforge.net/\">"
"http://gwenview.sourceforge.net/</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: extragear-applications.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "<application>Gwenview</application> Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: application
#: extragear-applications.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "ShowImg"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A feature-rich image viewer, written for &kde;, which can display numerous "
"formats, including <acronym>JPEG</acronym>, <acronym>PNG</acronym>"
", [animated] <acronym>GIF</acronym> and <acronym>MNG</acronym>"
". It consists of a tree-view frame, a directory/preview frame, and a view "
"frame. The (larger) view frame can be exchanged with the (smaller) "
"directory/preview frame. It can preview and display images from multiple "
"directories and search for identical images. <application>ShowImg</application> "
"also features a full-screen mode, zooming, sorting, drag and drop with "
"&konqueror;, and support for images in compressed archives."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://www.jalix.org/projects/showimg/\">"
"http://www.jalix.org/projects/showimg/</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: extragear-applications.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "<application>ShowImg</application> Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: application
#: extragear-applications.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "KimDaBa"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<application>KimDaBa</application> (&kde; Image Database) attempts to provide "
"an efficient solution for the organization of hundreds (or even thousands) of "
"images. Having been highly optimized for annotating images, <application>"
"KimDaBa</application> can help you locate an image in a matter of seconds."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://ktown.kde.org/kimdaba/\">"
"http://ktown.kde.org/kimdaba/</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: extragear-applications.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "<application>KimDaBa</application> Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: extragear-applications.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid "Network"
msgstr "Ret"

#. Tag: term
#: extragear-applications.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "&konversation;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A fully-featured <acronym>IRC</acronym> client which supports per channel "
"encoding, downloading and resuming file transfers, nick completion and "
"highlighting, as well as tight integration with &kontact; and the rest of "
"&kde;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://konversation.kde.org\">"
"http://konversation.kde.org</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: extragear-applications.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid "&konversation; Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: application
#: extragear-applications.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "KMldonkey"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A &kde; frontend for <application>MLDonkey</application>, a powerful <acronym>"
"P2P</acronym> file-sharing tool. Highly configurable, real-time graphical "
"bandwidth and network statistics, and much more."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "Website: <ulink url=\"http://kmldonkey.org/\">http://kmldonkey.org/</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#: extragear-applications.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "<application>KMldonkey</application> Handbook"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: application
#: extragear-applications.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "KNemo"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Displays for every network interface an icon in the systray. Tooltips and an "
"info dialog provide further information about the interface. Passive popups "
"inform about interface changes and a traffic plotter is also integrated."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:145
