msgid "Filelight"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A simple, yet ideal, application for graphically displaying where your diskpace "
"is being used. <application>Filelight</application> displays this information "
