#. Tag: application
#: extragear-applications.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid "Krecipes"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: extragear-applications.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A &kde; recipe tool that can manage a recipe database with an easy-to-use "
"interface. Full support for creating and removing ingredients as well as units; "
"helps with diets, can calculate the amount of calories, vitamins, carbohydrates "
"etc. Other advantages are its flexilibity and potential to extend further."
msgstr ""

